{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c1a1c1a1-0001-4a01-9a01-civicbackend01",
    "name": "CIVIC-AI Backend API (Server)",
    "description": "════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n CIVIC-AI Smart City Surveillance — Express Backend API\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n▶ SETUP\n1. Server start karo:  `cd server && npm run dev`  (http://localhost:8000)\n2. \"Auth → Login (admin)\" request chalao — ye automatically `access_token` aur `refresh_token` collection variables me save kar degi.\n3. Baaki auth-wale requests khud Bearer token use karengi.\n\n▶ DEMO CREDENTIALS (seedData.js se)\n• admin      / admin123       (sab permissions)\n• supervisor / supervisor123  (resolve + dispatch)\n• operator   / operator123    (sirf acknowledge)\n• amir.khan  / amir1234       (operator)\n• priya.nair / priya1234      (operator)\n\n▶ RBAC QUICK REFERENCE\n• Public (no token): health, alerts list/get/summary, cameras list/get, analytics sab, system-status, streams, settings GET, auth login/register/refresh/logout\n• acknowledge permission: alert acknowledge, camera PTZ\n• resolve permission (supervisor/admin): alert resolve, bulk-resolve\n• manage_cameras (admin): camera create/update/delete\n• admin only: settings PUT\n\n▶ NOTE\nHar route `/api` prefix ke saath aur bina dono par available hai (legacy alias): /api/alerts aur /alerts dono chalte hain.\n\n▶ WEBSOCKET\nws://localhost:8000/ws — Postman ke 'New WebSocket Request' se test karo.\nMessage shape: { \"type\": \"new_alert\", \"payload\": { \"alert\": {...} }, \"timestamp\": \"...\" }\nTypes: new_alert, alert_updated, camera_status, camera_created, camera_updated, camera_deleted, camera_ptz, stream_started, stream_stopped, settings_updated, system_status",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "civic-ai"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "alert_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "camera_numeric_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "camera_string_id", "value": "CAM-001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "stream_id", "value": "test-stream-1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Liveness probe. Response: `{ \"status\": \"ok\", \"service\": \"civic-ai-server\", \"timestamp\": \"...\" }`"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"status ok\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"ok\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 · Auth",
      "description": "JWT auth flow. Login/Register ke baad tokens collection variables me auto-save hote hain.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/login  (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", json.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", json.refresh_token);",
                  "  console.log(\"✅ access_token + refresh_token saved\");",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"tokens returned\", () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a(\"string\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"user role admin\", () => pm.expect(json.user.role).to.eql(\"admin\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Username YA email dono se login hota hai. Response: access_token (15m), refresh_token (7d), user with permissions.\n\nYe request chalane par tokens auto-save ho jate hain — baaki requests Bearer {{access_token}} use karti hain."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/login  (operator — email se)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", json.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"rajesh.k@command.smartcity.gov\",\n  \"password\": \"operator123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Email se login. Operator role ke paas sirf `view` + `acknowledge` permissions hain — resolve/403 test karne ke liye isse use karo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/register  (public signup)",
          "request": {
